Subject: [PATCH] perf: run the SPC/DSP audio render on a worker thread, hand
 its APU ports to the cartridge before the next tick

Also adds STARFOX_TRACE_FRAME_HASH (per-frame FNV digest of the indexed
framebuffer, for byte-exact regression checks) and rtx/hdr profile stages.

